	if len(snapshots) == 0 {
		panic("WeightedScoring.Route: empty snapshots")
	}

	// HYPOTHESIS-1: Reverting to proven minLoad-based quadratic penalty (0.15) with added PendingRequests penalty will reduce avg_p95_ms below 5100 by preventing pile-on during spikes
	// MECHANISM-1: PendingRequests tracks in-flight but not-yet-queued requests; penalizing them reduces routing oscillation that inflates P95 tail latency
	// EXPECT-1: avg_p95_ms < 5100
	// RESULT-1: REFUTED (actual=5199.292633333333)

